<PolicyLayout title="Privacy policy" description="How the 17 Mechanical website handles project enquiries and Google Maps reviews.">
  <p>This policy explains information handled through the 17 Mechanical HVAC/R Ltd. website.</p>
  <h2>Project enquiries</h2>
  <p>When you submit our form, we use your name, email address, service selection, project details and any optional company or phone information to respond to your enquiry. Cloudflare processes the form and delivers the message to 17hvac@gmail.com. The website does not maintain a separate database of enquiries.</p>
  <p>Cloudflare processes connection information, including your IP address, to host and protect the website. The form uses your IP address to limit repeated submissions. Email messages are handled by Cloudflare and Google’s email services.</p>
  <h2>Google Maps reviews</h2>
  <p>When automatic reviews are enabled and you approach the reviews section, your browser connects to Google Maps to request the company’s rating and public reviews. Google receives connection information associated with that request. Reviews and author information are displayed with Google attribution; this website does not save the fetched reviews to browser storage or a separate reviews database.</p>
  <p>Use of Google Maps features is subject to the <a href="https://www.google.com/policies/privacy/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Google Privacy Policy (opens in a new tab)</a>. Visit <a href="https://www.cloudflare.com/privacypolicy/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Cloudflare’s Privacy Policy (opens in a new tab)</a> for information about its services. Cloudflare Web Analytics may also provide aggregate information about website visits.</p>
  <h2>Contact</h2>
  <p>For questions about information you have sent through this website, contact <a href="mailto:17hvac@gmail.com">17hvac@gmail.com</a>.</p>
</PolicyLayout>
